#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Filename              :       ValidateBillerRef_DoBillerVal.scr
# Author                :       Venkatesh T R
# Description           :       This script does validation against C_CIC
# Input                 :       Account ID, Reference Num
# Output                :       None
# Called Script         :       ValidateBillerRef_main.scr
# Calling Script        :       None
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----           -----           --------          ----------------        ---------
